            "body": "@merrymercy @Fridge003 @ispobock @Qiaolin-Yu @hebiao064 @HaiShaw — Hey team! Per #28808, TRTLLMHAAttnBackend was inheriting from FlashInferAttnBackend but overriding every attention method and allocating a bunch of prefill/decode wrappers plus indices updaters that the TRTLLM path never touches. This PR moves it to inherit from AttentionBackend directly — 40/9 diff, no behavior change, same public API. Take a look when you get a chance!\n",
