    "body": "## Summary\nFix sgl-project/sglang#28808.\n\n`TRTLLMHAAttnBackend(FlashInferAttnBackend)` overrode every attention-specific\nmethod (init_forward_metadata, forward_decode, forward_extend, get_cuda_graph_seq_len_fill_value, ...).\nThe only real reuse from the FlashInfer parent was ~10 lines of init plumbing:\ntoken/KV pool construction, kv_indptr/kv_last_page_len buffer allocation,\nskip_prefill flag, and SWA resolution.\n\nInheriting from FlashInferAttnBackend additionally allocated:\n- `prefill_wrapper_ragged`, `prefill_wrappers_paged`, `prefill_wrappers_verify`\n- `decode_wrappers`\n- `FlashInferIndicesUpdater*` objects\n- shared `global_workspace_buffer`\n\nNone of these are used on the TRTLLM path. Several fields were also set twice:\n`_swa_kv_pool` and `max_context_len`.\n\n**Change:** TRTLLMHAAttnBackend now inherits directly from `AttentionBackend`.\nThe small amount of genuinely-shared setup is inlined. No behavioral change\nintended — all public API is preserved.\n\nDiff: 1 file, +40 / -9.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] Code inspection — identical public API surface, all method signatures unchanged\n- [x] `python -m py_compile python/sglang/srt/layers/attention/trtllm_mha_backend.py` succeeds\n- [x] No new runtime paths added\n\n/cc @merrymercy\n\n---\nDCO: Signed-off-by: yancy <yancy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38412114019](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38412114019)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38412113292](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38412113292)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38412113161](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38412113161)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
